# Normalize line endings so the worktree matches the index and Prettier's
# `endOfLine: lf`.
#
# Without this, `core.autocrlf=true` rewrites files to CRLF on checkout on
# Windows while the index and Prettier both expect LF. The result is a blocking
# `npm run format:check` failure on files nobody edited, plus phantom
# modifications in `git status` that show an empty `git diff`. That is not
# cosmetic: it makes it impossible to tell a real edit from line-ending noise
# when reviewing a diff.
#
# `text=auto` leaves binary assets (PNGs, fonts, media fixtures) alone; the repo
# has no files that need an explicit override.
* text=auto eol=lf
